{"id":"6da8e7b12b3b6d38","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-oriented-cone-generators.md","title":"Oriented Sphere and Cone Generators","display":"df-oriented-cone-generators — Oriented Sphere and Cone Generators","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-oriented-cone-generators","aliases":["58-df-oriented-cone-generators"],"display":"df-oriented-cone-generators — Oriented Sphere and Cone Generators","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-cone-topology-data.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-singular-coefficient-data.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-oriented-cone-generators"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-oriented-cone-generators</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-oriented-cone-generators — Oriented Sphere and Cone Generators"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d2d4ae7a9b4ff171\" href=\"?note=d2d4ae7a9b4ff171\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cone-topology-data.md\">../batch11/58-df-cone-topology-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"78ee5e5ffa2f4a64\" href=\"?note=78ee5e5ffa2f4a64\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-singular-coefficient-data.md\">../batch03/58-df-singular-coefficient-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ca7fc3ab38a11801\" href=\"?note=ca7fc3ab38a11801\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md\">../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\omega\">\\(k\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^k=\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^{k+1}:\\sum_{i\\le k}x(i)^2=1\\}\">\\(S^k=\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^{k+1}:\\sum_{i\\le k}x(i)^2=1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_k=\\operatorname{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(S^k,k+1)\">\\(\\tau_k=\\operatorname{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(S^k,k+1)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_k\\)</span> 使用 <code>58-df-singular-chain-cochain-data</code>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_i\">\\(e_i\\)</span> 是标准坐标向量。</li>\n<li>对空间 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,\\tau)\">\\((A,\\tau)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma(A,\\tau)=\\langle A,\\tau,\\mathbb Z,+,\\cdot,0,1\\rangle\">\\(\\sigma(A,\\tau)=\\langle A,\\tau,\\mathbb Z,+,\\cdot,0,1\\rangle\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_k=\\sigma(S^k,\\tau_k)\">\\(\\sigma_k=\\sigma(S^k,\\tau_k)\\)</span>。链、上链、微分、商类和映射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^\\#,f^\\flat,f_*,f^*\">\\(f^\\#,f^\\flat,f_*,f^*\\)</span> 使用 <code>58-df-singular-coefficient-data</code> 的带系数构造。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf1_{P}\\in\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbf1_{P}\\in\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf1_P=1\\leftrightarrow P\">\\(\\mathbf1_P=1\\leftrightarrow P\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ev}(a,c)=\\sum_{s\\in\\operatorname{supp}c}c(s)a(s)\">\\(\\operatorname{ev}(a,c)=\\sum_{s\\in\\operatorname{supp}c}c(s)a(s)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in C^r(\\sigma)\">\\(a\\in C^r(\\sigma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in C_r(\\sigma)\">\\(c\\in C_r(\\sigma)\\)</span> 是该配对的定义域。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge2\">\\(n\\ge2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=2n\">\\(m=2n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:S^{m-1}\\to S^n\">\\(f:S^{m-1}\\to S^n\\)</span> 连续，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 是其固定标记映射锥，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_C\">\\(\\tau_C\\)</span> 为 <code>58-df-cone-topology-data</code> 的唯一商拓扑，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_C=\\sigma(C,\\tau_C)\">\\(\\sigma_C=\\sigma(C,\\tau_C)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_f,j_f\">\\(q_f,j_f\\)</span> 使用该依赖。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa_{f,\\epsilon}\">\\(\\kappa_{f,\\epsilon}\\)</span> 的定义域是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_m\">\\(\\Delta_m\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_{k,\\epsilon}\">\\(s_{k,\\epsilon}\\)</span> 的定义域是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_k\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_\\epsilon(\\beta)=\\sum_{i&lt;m}\\epsilon(i)\\beta(i+1)e_i\\in\\mathbb R^m\">\\(v_\\epsilon(\\beta)=\\sum_{i&lt;m}\\epsilon(i)\\beta(i+1)e_i\\in\\mathbb R^m\\)</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta(0)&lt;1\">\\(\\beta(0)&lt;1\\)</span> 时它非零。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CanonicalConeGenerators}_S(x,y,C,n)\">\\(\\operatorname{CanonicalConeGenerators}_S(x,y,C,n)\\)</span> 保留原四元接口；下式通过商编码恢复粘合映射，不额外选择顶胞腔的符号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\ns_{k,\\epsilon}(t)&amp;:=\\frac{\\sum_{i\\le k}\\epsilon(i)t(i)e_i}\n{\\sqrt{\\sum_{i\\le k}t(i)^2}}\n\\quad(\\epsilon\\in\\{-1,1\\}^{k+1},\\ t\\in\\Delta_k),\\\\\nz_k&amp;:=\\Bigl\\{\\Bigl\\langle s,\\sum_{\\epsilon\\in\\{-1,1\\}^{k+1}}\n\\Bigl(\\prod_{i\\le k}\\epsilon(i)\\Bigr)\\mathbf1_{s=s_{k,\\epsilon}}\\Bigr\\rangle:\ns\\in S_k(S^k,\\tau_k)\\Bigr\\},\\\\\n\\kappa_{f,\\epsilon}(\\beta)&amp;:=\n\\begin{cases}\nq_f(\\iota_C(e_0,1)),&amp;\\beta(0)=1,\\\\\nq_f\\!\\left(\\iota_C\\!\\left(v_\\epsilon(\\beta)/\\|v_\\epsilon(\\beta)\\|,\\beta(0)\\right)\\right),&amp;\\beta(0)&lt;1,\n\\end{cases}\\\\\nb_f&amp;:=\\Bigl\\{\\Bigl\\langle s,\\sum_{\\epsilon\\in\\{-1,1\\}^{m}}\n\\Bigl(\\prod_{i&lt;m}\\epsilon(i)\\Bigr)\\mathbf1_{s=\\kappa_{f,\\epsilon}}\\Bigr\\rangle:\ns\\in S_m(C,\\tau_C)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\ns_{k,\\epsilon}(t)&amp;:=\\frac{\\sum_{i\\le k}\\epsilon(i)t(i)e_i}\n{\\sqrt{\\sum_{i\\le k}t(i)^2}}\n\\quad(\\epsilon\\in\\{-1,1\\}^{k+1},\\ t\\in\\Delta_k),\\\\\nz_k&amp;:=\\Bigl\\{\\Bigl\\langle s,\\sum_{\\epsilon\\in\\{-1,1\\}^{k+1}}\n\\Bigl(\\prod_{i\\le k}\\epsilon(i)\\Bigr)\\mathbf1_{s=s_{k,\\epsilon}}\\Bigr\\rangle:\ns\\in S_k(S^k,\\tau_k)\\Bigr\\},\\\\\n\\kappa_{f,\\epsilon}(\\beta)&amp;:=\n\\begin{cases}\nq_f(\\iota_C(e_0,1)),&amp;\\beta(0)=1,\\\\\nq_f\\!\\left(\\iota_C\\!\\left(v_\\epsilon(\\beta)/\\|v_\\epsilon(\\beta)\\|,\\beta(0)\\right)\\right),&amp;\\beta(0)&lt;1,\n\\end{cases}\\\\\nb_f&amp;:=\\Bigl\\{\\Bigl\\langle s,\\sum_{\\epsilon\\in\\{-1,1\\}^{m}}\n\\Bigl(\\prod_{i&lt;m}\\epsilon(i)\\Bigr)\\mathbf1_{s=\\kappa_{f,\\epsilon}}\\Bigr\\rangle:\ns\\in S_m(C,\\tau_C)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nk&gt;0&amp;\\Longrightarrow z_k\\in Z_k(\\sigma_k),\\\\\nb_f&amp;\\in C_m(\\sigma_C),\\qquad\n\\partial_{\\sigma_C,m}b_f=(j_f)^\\#_{\\sigma_n,\\sigma_C,m-1}\n\\bigl(f^\\#_{\\sigma_{m-1},\\sigma_n,m-1}z_{m-1}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nk&gt;0&amp;\\Longrightarrow z_k\\in Z_k(\\sigma_k),\\\\\nb_f&amp;\\in C_m(\\sigma_C),\\qquad\n\\partial_{\\sigma_C,m}b_f=(j_f)^\\#_{\\sigma_n,\\sigma_C,m-1}\n\\bigl(f^\\#_{\\sigma_{m-1},\\sigma_n,m-1}z_{m-1}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oriented\\text{-}cone\\text{-}generators}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{CanonicalConeGenerators}_S(x,y,C,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0,1\\}\\land\n\\exists f,\\tau_C,c,a_x,a_y\\;[\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{ConeTopology}_{58,S}(\\tau_C,C,f,S^{2n-1},\\tau_{2n-1},S^n,\\tau_n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land x\\in H^n(\\sigma_C)\\land y\\in H^{2n}(\\sigma_C)\n\\land a_x\\in x\\land a_y\\in y\\\\\n&amp;\\land c\\in C_{2n}(\\sigma_n)\n\\land\\partial_{\\sigma_n,2n}c=f^\\#_{\\sigma_{2n-1},\\sigma_n,2n-1}z_{2n-1}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{ev}\\bigl(a_x,(j_f)^\\#_{\\sigma_n,\\sigma_C,n}z_n\\bigr)=1\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{ev}\\bigl(a_y,b_f-(j_f)^\\#_{\\sigma_n,\\sigma_C,2n}c\\bigr)=1].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oriented\\text{-}cone\\text{-}generators}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{CanonicalConeGenerators}_S(x,y,C,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0,1\\}\\land\n\\exists f,\\tau_C,c,a_x,a_y\\;[\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{ConeTopology}_{58,S}(\\tau_C,C,f,S^{2n-1},\\tau_{2n-1},S^n,\\tau_n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land x\\in H^n(\\sigma_C)\\land y\\in H^{2n}(\\sigma_C)\n\\land a_x\\in x\\land a_y\\in y\\\\\n&amp;\\land c\\in C_{2n}(\\sigma_n)\n\\land\\partial_{\\sigma_n,2n}c=f^\\#_{\\sigma_{2n-1},\\sigma_n,2n-1}z_{2n-1}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{ev}\\bigl(a_x,(j_f)^\\#_{\\sigma_n,\\sigma_C,n}z_n\\bigr)=1\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{ev}\\bigl(a_y,b_f-(j_f)^\\#_{\\sigma_n,\\sigma_C,2n}c\\bigr)=1].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>球面基本闭链由交叉多面体的带符号面逐项给出。锥链采用顶点在前的次序，边界的目标球面项因此带正号；这固定了原文件所要求的有向整数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_f\">\\(b_f\\)</span> 一般不是绝对闭链；减去粘合边界在目标球面上的填充链后才用于绝对上同调配对。填充链和上闭链代表的选择不改变两个归一化条件。</li>\n<li>这里不把“任意一对生成元”当成规范生成元，也不把绝对同调与相对同调的代表混用。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hatcher, Algebraic Topology, §4.B (Hopf invariant).</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cone-topology-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"d2d4ae7a9b4ff171","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cone-topology-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-singular-coefficient-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"78ee5e5ffa2f4a64","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-singular-coefficient-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca7fc3ab38a11801","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"S^k=\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^{k+1}:\\sum_{i\\le k}x(i)^2=1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_k=\\operatorname{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(S^k,k+1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_k","display":false},{"tex":"e_i","display":false},{"tex":"(A,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma(A,\\tau)=\\langle A,\\tau,\\mathbb Z,+,\\cdot,0,1\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma_k=\\sigma(S^k,\\tau_k)","display":false},{"tex":"f^\\#,f^\\flat,f_*,f^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf1_{P}\\in\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf1_P=1\\leftrightarrow P","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ev}(a,c)=\\sum_{s\\in\\operatorname{supp}c}c(s)a(s)","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in C^r(\\sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"c\\in C_r(\\sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"n\\ge2","display":false},{"tex":"m=2n","display":false},{"tex":"f:S^{m-1}\\to S^n","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_C","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma_C=\\sigma(C,\\tau_C)","display":false},{"tex":"q_f,j_f","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa_{f,\\epsilon